>> a := Kipengee mpya.
>> b := Kipengee mpya.
>> c := a.
Towe andika: a anwani-ya-kumbukumbu herufi-zote ? 0, mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: a anwani-ya-kumbukumbu herufi-zote ? 1, mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: a anwani-ya-kumbukumbu = b anwani-ya-kumbukumbu, mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: a anwani-ya-kumbukumbu = c anwani-ya-kumbukumbu, mstari-mpya.
